{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123148","id":4435911227,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCGaiOw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123148","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123148.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123148.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123148","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123148/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123148/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123148/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/29dca1ae68137631cdaa5fb1462dd75a788e7753","number":123148,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make path `CSGPolygon3D` dirty when entering tree","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #76514\r\n\r\nIf a `CSGPolygon3D` set to `MODE_PATH` gets removed from tree, it also gets disconnected from its path to stop updating.\r\n\r\nWhen it is re-added, however, it's never told to re-connect, unless collisions are enabled (in which case `CSGShape3D::_notification()` will handle it), or we do something to manually make it dirty (like setting it to `MODE_PATH` again immediately after it re-enters the tree).\r\n\r\nThe simplest fix I found was to call `_make_dirty()` when re-entering the tree, specifically for `CSGPolygon3D` when it's `MODE_PATH`. The check for collision usage is just to ensure it won't mark it as dirty twice.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Reproduction project\r\nSame as the issue, but modified for demonstration: [csg_polygon_exit_enter_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31802891/csg_polygon_exit_enter_bug.zip)\r\n\r\n### Before fix\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11891602-ffb1-4e02-a5fc-9b26fddc617c\r\n\r\nOne still works because, as mentioned, it's set to `MODE_PATH` again which marks it as dirty.\r\n\r\n### After fix\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e2daeae-073e-4cb5-9c2d-38ab9d71a7db","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repite